[2][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Man know thyself;<br>then thou shalt know<br>the Universe<br>and God "][Pythagoras]#]
[3][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Material Nature has three modes.<br>&nbsp;Goodness<br>&nbsp;Passion<br>&nbsp;Ignorance"][- Krsna]#]
[4][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Confidence and stupidity are a very dangerous combination, but they generally go together."][- Sadhguru]#]
[5][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["If you resist change, you resist life."][- Sadhguru]#]
[6][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["If you are alone and miserable, of course you are in bad company."][- Sadhguru]#]
[7][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Karma means ultimate responsibility. You even take responsibility for your genetics."][- Sadhguru]#]
[8][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["When we say "This is my Karma",<br>We are actually saying "I'm Responsible for my life"<br>"][- Sadhguru]#]
[9][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Don't be stingy with selfishness. At least with selfishness, be generous."][- Sadhguru]#]
[10][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["You do not have to do anything, you do not have to think anything, you do not have to feel anything to be complete. You are a Complete Life as You are."][- Sadhguru]#]
[11][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["The most <b>Beautiful Moments of Life</b> are moments when you are expressing your <b>joy</b>, not when you are seeking it."][- Sadhguru]#]
[12][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["What you <b>know</b> is a miniscule.<br>What you <b>do not know</b> is an endless possibility."][- Sadhguru]#]
[13][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Nothing is contradictory, everything is complimentary to each other."][- Sadhguru]#]
[14][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["I don't know." is not ignorance.<br>It is tremendous possibility.][- Sadhguru]#]
[15][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Fate is a destiny unintended."][- Sadhguru]#]
[16][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["If you have humanity, you don't need morality."][- Sadhguru]#]
[17][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Your dreams are just exagerations of what you already know."][- Sadhguru]#]
[18][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["If you don't enjoy your own company, that means you're in bad company obviously."][- Sadhguru]#]
[19][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["Only when you do not know yourself, the opinion of other people becomes important."][- Sadhguru]#]
[20][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["<b>Incredible</b> things can be done simply,<br>if we are <b>committed</b> to <b>making</b> them <b>happen</b>."][- Sadhguru]#]
[21][#OML[EL_QUOTE]["You can't change a system<br>by fighting or complaining about it.<br>You must adopt a new model<br>which makes the old system obsolete."][- R. Buckminster Fuller]#]
